[{"sha":"450d2c8a663191b24ea9e6bd1c248dfd396b9e2f","node_id":"C_kwDOUJxystoAKDQ1MGQyYzhhNjYzMTkxYjI0ZWE5ZTZiZDFjMjQ4ZGZkMzk2YjllMmY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Richard Huo","email":"huodianyan@126.com","date":"2026-09-21T13:52:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Richard Huo","email":"huodianyan@126.com","date":"2026-09-21T13:52:58Z"},"message":"software: imu_to_dxl 板级诊断 —— 分诊真源页 + `dxl_ping` 只读 read/sync-read + `0x55` 定论\n\n- 新建 wiki/concepts/imu-to-dxl-firmware-triage.md：`@136` status 位表 · 「官方事务对 IMU 死的板\n  静默返回 12 个零、daemon 不报错」这个坑 · 逐块判定流程 · 2026-09-21 逐块结果\n- scripts/dxl_ping.py：补只读子命令 `read`（原始块）与 `sync-read`（`0x82` 广播，复刻官方总线形状，\n  逐 ID 报「答了但块全 0」）；`self-test` 加第 9 组并用注入故障验证（广播改单播 / 静默 ID 丢弃 /\n  空块当失败，三处全被抓到）\n- 订正 `0x55` 口径：它就是 DXL 2.0 Status 包的 Instruction 字段，`LEN = DATA + 4` 才是规格 ——\n  证据为本仓 `imu_to_dxl/firmware/src/dxl_slave.c` 的 `#define INST_STATUS 0x55` 与\n  `dynamixel_sdk` 在 U2D2 收该帧 1000/1000（独立实现做锚）\n- .cursor/skills/microduck-software/SKILL.md：新增「板级诊断（U2D2 · 主控）」节 ——\n  命令 + 判据 + 指路，判据真源仍留 wiki\n\n同树并存的其它角色未提交改动一并入库（同仓同人，非破坏性）：\n- hardware：`dxl_ping.py` 只读位置族（`Homing Offset` / 位置限位 / `Goal`·`Present Position`）·\n  `PWM Slope(62)` 语义核准确认对外问询函一处错注 · 问询函 PDF 随源重生 · HAT 喇叭座 J1 座型与网表\n- governance：`AGENTS.md` 加「`log.md` 只读尾部 · 不整读」\n- ingest：VKESMD（SIAR MD 系列）三份厂商文档 ingest + `xl330-vs-siar-md` 逐条对照\n- structure：`cad/microduck_rl_assembly_a1mini.3mf` 更新\n\n校验：`dxl_ping.py self-test` 绿（含新第 9 组）· `wiki_lint` 63 页 0 error / 2 warning（即已批准例外页）·\n`refs_lint` 78 文件 327 引用 0 error · `lint_selftest` 8/8\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e99ff1a382d356700fd2ec18801a64903492a8cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/git/trees/e99ff1a382d356700fd2ec18801a64903492a8cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/git/commits/450d2c8a663191b24ea9e6bd1c248dfd396b9e2f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://a