te and record #4 recheck scope\n\n- Track 10 wiki docs that existed only locally (hat-dxl-bus-debug,\n  hat-solder-kit, zero3w-bench-plan, xl330-cn-bench-kit,\n  bam-identification-bench, body-imu-hat-dxl-power-eval, raw articles,\n  NP-F550 order sheet) plus updated BOM/concept pages\n- hat-dxl-bus-debug 7.1: recheck items and branch-localization\n  requirement for the main-controller to HAT DXL DATA gap (#4)\n- log.md: entry for the #4 recheck scope\n- gitignore: keep local scratch and vendor downloads out (res/, tmp/)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"73f5d8922214181ab6fb9827965f537e619b2650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/git/trees/73f5d8922214181ab6fb9827965f537e619b2650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/git/commits/fa6660483f2827685930ee8903044b8290e0efa1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/commits/fa6660483f2827685930ee8903044b8290e0efa1","html_url":"https://github.com/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/commit/fa6660483f2827685930ee8903044b8290e0efa1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScrapMeta/microduck-diy/commits/fa6660483f2827685930ee8903044b8290e0efa1/comments","author":{"login":"XianWorld","id":8578566,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Nzg1NjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8578566?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/XianWorld","html_url":"https://github.com/XianWorld","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XianWorld/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XianWorld/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XianWorld/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XianWorld/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XianWorld/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xia